From: TekRantGaming <craigferels896@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:02:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] D3D12: built-in ambient occlusion shaders, off by default

The AO passes are compiled into the plugin (ambient_occlusion.cs.hlsl, fxc /T cs_5_1 /O3); REX_DEV_AO still loads a source file for tuning. ao_mode defaults to 0. Only with host render targets for now (the ROV path, used on Intel GPUs, is untested).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
